# Release safety

This repository publishes the marketing site only. Pushing it does not update the app API or the app database.

Do not start an app phase from a website task. Do not change app prices, credits, or schema from here.

Deploy only when the founder asks. After a website publish, open the live URL that changed, including a phone-width check.

If copy depends on an app feature, confirm that feature is live before the page ships. A website release must not announce something the app URL does not do yet.
